From 3499bc284e8d4685a51051f3252041bf010a1a62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "vincent.yen" <vincent.yen@mitaccomputing.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 22:04:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] cpld: port latest multi-device updater implementation

Port the updated CPLD software updater implementation with support for
Lattice XO2, XO3, XO5 and Altera MAX10 devices.

The commit reference range is from f6470b5e95618fa0eeb8b03b37c53a311dfc1ef3
to 147d0f7c325d08f9a0cd0e21d5a9d0cebba4a50f.

Add the synchronous vector-based I2C transfer API required by the new
device implementations. Add the common GPIO mux controller and async
retry helper used during CPLD version retrieval and firmware updates.

Keep the existing SoftwareManager object-path API and adapt the CPLD
manager to it. Also adapt the Meson dependencies to the versions already
used by this branch.

The MuxChannel-based dynamic I2C bus lookup is intentionally not included
and will be added separately.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [No upstream maintenance]
